Description: Oaxaca desktop fonts (JetBrains Mono Nerd Font, iA Writer)
 The two font families the Oaxaca desktop asks for by name and
 Ubuntu's archive does not carry:
 .
  * JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (Regular, Bold, Italic, Bold Italic): the
    JetBrains Mono typeface patched by the Nerd Fonts project with icon
    glyphs. The desktop shell, the terminal and the editor configuration
    ask for "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font", and the icons in the shell's bar
    and menus come from this font.
  * iA Writer Mono S, Quattro S, Duo S and Duospace (Regular, Bold,
    Italic, Bold Italic): the writing typefaces of iA Writer, derived
    from IBM Plex, used for documents and notes.
 .
 The files install under /usr/share/fonts/truetype/oaxaca/.
